+
+## Playback in Games
+
+A cached clip plays once in the selected artwork tile after six seconds on the same game in any layout. Browsing, entering a game or leaving the screen cancels the pending or playing preview. The first frame is read from the card only after the delay. The player streams into two 38,400-byte frame buffers and releases them when finished. Highlight the title again for a replay or use the scan screen for immediate playback.
 
